  <div class="pane__content">
    <div class="paragraph--wysiwyg">
      <h2>When to make an appointment</h2><p>You can only make an appoint when you have received a letter from the IND. This can be in these situations:</p><ul><li>You have submitted an application for a residence permit. And you have received a letter of receipt for this application from the IND.</li><li>You have received a letter from the IND that we need photo, signature and fingerprints to make your residence document.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>When you make an appointment before receiving a letter, your appointment will be cancelled.</p><h2>Make an appointment</h2><p>At the Desk or Service Point, the IND will take a digital passport photo and take your fingerprints. The IND does not accept photos taken elsewhere by a photographer. You can choose which location you want to go to.&nbsp;</p><p>Providing biometrics is free of charge. If you choose to provide your biometrics at an expat centre, you may have to pay an (additional) fee.</p><h3>Providing biometrics in Amsterdam, Den Haag, Haarlem, 's-Hertogenbosch, Zwolle, Enschede or Utrecht</h3><p>Would you like to provide biometrics at an IND desk in Amsterdam, Den Haag, Haarlem, 's-Hertogenbosch or Zwolle? Or at an Expat Centre in Enschede or Utrecht? <span>Then you can make an appointment at the</span> IND. <span>There, the IND will take a digital passport photo and take your fingerprints.&nbsp;</span></p><p><a class="btn btn--wysiwyg btn--primary" href="https://oap.ind.nl/oap/en/#/BIO" title="Make appointment at IND Desk or IND Service Point">Make appointment at IND desk</a></p><h3>Providing biometrics in Goes</h3><p>Do you live in the province of Zeeland or a municipality in the Brabantse Wal? <span>Then you can make an appointment at the IND Service Point in Goes. There, the IND will take a digital passport photo and take your fingerprints.&nbsp;</span></p><p><a class="btn btn--wysiwyg btn--primary" href="https://www.goes.nl/afspraak-maken#select/fproductguid/1307872d-6dbf-4f2d-bd72-ea150a3e389b/IND-afnemen-biometrische-gegeven" title="Make appointment in Goes"><span>Make appointment in Goes</span></a></p><h3>Providing biometrics in Maastricht</h3><p>Do you live in the province of Limburg? <span>Then you can make an appointment at the Expat Centre Maastricht. There, the IND will take a digital passport photo and take your fingerprints.</span></p><p><a class="btn btn--wysiwyg btn--primary" href="https://afspraak.mic.maastricht.nl/qmaticwebbooking/#/preselect/services/720a95cc09311a731579b918183fde2f6b00efc5a56dfe401997444720c3b1d0" title="Make appointment in Maastricht"><span>Make appointment in Maastricht</span></a></p><h3>Providing biometrics in Nijmegen</h3><p>Do you live in the Nijmegen or Arnhem area? <span>Then you can make an appointment at the IND Service Point in Nijmegen. There, the IND will take a digital passport photo and take your fingerprints.&nbsp;</span></p><p><a class="btn btn--wysiwyg btn--primary" href="https://nijmegen.mijnafspraakmaken.nl/?lang=en&amp;link=1679&amp;product=214" title="Make appointment in Goes"><span>Make appointment in Nijmegen</span></a></p><h3>Biometrics for a child under 2 years</h3><p>Is the residence document for a child under 2 years old? Then do not make an appointment for providing biometrics. Send a passport photo of the child to the using the <a href="https://ind.nl/en/forms/7630.pdf" title="Appendix Passport photo form">Appendix Passport photo form</a>. The passport photo must be taken by a photographer. Read more about the <a href="https://www.government.nl/topics/identification-documents/requirements-for-photos">requirements for the passport photo</a>.</p><h2>Biometrics appointment Ukraine</h2><p><span>Do you come under the Temporary Protection Directive Ukraine? But has the IND not yet taken your biometric data? </span><a href="/en/ukraine/ukraine-make-an-appointment" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="e263defd-b52d-446e-a4e2-77b1386e2ab7" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ukraine: make an appointment"><span>Then make an appointment for biometric data collection on the Ukraine: make an appointment page</span></a><span>. На Вас поширюється дія Директиви про Тимчасовий захист для українців</span><span lang="UK" dir="ltr">, а</span><span> Служб</span><span lang="UK" dir="ltr">а</span><span> іміграції і натуралізації&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" dir="ltr">ще немає Ваших біометричних дани</span><span lang="UK" dir="ltr">х</span><span lang="RU" dir="ltr">?&nbsp;</span><a href="/en/ukraine/ukraine-make-an-appointment" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="e263defd-b52d-446e-a4e2-77b1386e2ab7" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Ukraine: make an appointment"><span>Тоді призначте зустріч для зняття біометричних даних на сторінці Україна: Призначити зустріч.</span></a></p><h2>Appropriate clothing for passport photo</h2><p>We kindly ask you not to wear completely white or light grey clothing. The passport photo is taken against a light grey background. If you wear light clothing, the photo may turn out wrong.</p><p><span lang="en" dir="ltr">You may keep your head covered for religious or philosophical reasons. The head covering must not cover your face. We also recommend wearing a plain colored head covering that is not light gray. If your head covering has reflective material or busy patterns, the photo may turn out wrong.</span></p><h2>Information about your appointment</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

        </div>
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
      </div>
