<section class="pane pane--default" data-pane-type="accordion">
  <div class="container ">
    <div class="no-gutters row">
      <div class="col-12">
                                                      <div class="pane__content">
            <div class="row">
    <div class="col-12 col-md-8">
      <div class="paragraph--accordion">
  <div class="accordion">
    <a class="accordion__toggler initializing" role='button' tabindex='0'>
      <span class="accordion__action accordion__action--open">Show details</span>
      <span class="accordion__action accordion__action--close">Hide details</span>
    </a>

    <ul class="accordion__content">
                        <li class="accordion-item "
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>What to bring to your appointment</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>Bring the following documents to your appointment:</p><ul><li>Your valid passport or other travel document.</li><li>Your appointment code. This code is in the email you receive when you make an appointment online.</li><li>Do or did you already have a residence permit in the Netherlands? Or a Foreign Nationals Identity Document (VI) type W or W2? Then bring your (expired) residence document or VI.</li><li>Have you lost your residence document or Foreign Nationals Identity Document (VI) type W or W2? Or has it been stolen? Then bring the report of the loss or theft reported to the police.</li></ul><h4>Appointment for a child of the age of 2 or older who was born in the Netherlands</h4><p>As the parent of the child, you must bring the following documents to the appointment:</p><ul><li>Your valid passport or valid residence document.</li><li>The child's valid passport, or the (copy of) birth certificate, or the (copy of) registration of the child in the Personal Records Database (in Dutch: Basisregistratie Personen or BRP) at the municipality.</li></ul>
                              </div>
      </li>
                        <li class="accordion-item "
          >
        <a class="accordion-item__heading" role='button' tabindex='0'>
          <h3>Reschedule or cancel an appointment</h3>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--open">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#open"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
          <span class="accordion-item__handler accordion-item__handler--close">
            
<svg aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
     role="img" class="icon icon--24 ">
    <use xlink:href="/themes/custom/ind/static/symbol/svg/sprite.symbol.svg#minus"></use>
</svg>
          </span>
        </a>
        <div class="accordion-item__content" hidden="until-found">
          
                                    <p>Have you made an appointment, but are you unable to attend? It is not possible to reschedule your appointment. There is a link in the email with the appointment confirmation. Click on the link and cancel your appointment. After that, make a new appointment.</p><p>Have you made an appointment for multiple people? You can only cancel the entire appointment and not for just 1 person.</p>
                              </div>
      </li>
          </ul>
  </div>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
        </div>
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

        
  
